&lt;h2 id="location-description">Location Description&lt;/h2>
&lt;p>An ancient city of Campania destroyed by the volcanic eruption of Mt. Vesuvius in CE 79, Pompeii was named as a UNESCO World Heritage Site in 1997.&lt;/p>
